{"id":"75e21970a4ed","path":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/partners-innovation","lang":"en","title":"Partners in Innovation","description":"Diversi sono i partner aziendali che tramite USI Transfer hanno potuto giovare della collaborazione con la nostra Università in ambito di trasferimento tecnologico e della conoscenza. Vuoi sapere di più su come promuoviamo e facilitiamo la collaborazione con il mondo aziendale? S","section":"Innovation","crumbs":["Innovation","Innovate","USI Transfer","For Industry"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/usitransfer-loghi-collaboration-2023.jpg?itok=vaCPEJs1","words":94,"alternates":{"it":"/it/innovazione/innovare/usi-transfer/industria/partner-innovazione","en":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/partners-innovation"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Innovation","path":"/en/originalnode/23939"},{"label":"Innovate","path":"/en/originalnode/23935"},{"label":"USI Transfer","path":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer"},{"label":"For Industry","path":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/licensing-opportunities"},{"label":"Partners in Innovation","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Through USI Transfer many partners have been profiting from the collaboration with our University in the field of technology and knowledge transfer. Interested in how we promote and facilitate collaboration with companies? Have a look at our brochure:</p> <p><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/usitransfer/usitransfer-for-companies-brochure.pdf\">USI Transfer for companies</a></p> <p>The expertise and infrastructure of USI are open to companies. Our experts are active in a broad spectrum of research fields and they transfer state-of-the-art academic results to industry.<br> Explore the available expertise and fields of activitiy:</p> <p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/competence-areas\">Map of expertise</a></p> <p>Reach out to us for more information:</p> <p><a href=\"/en/originalnode/22653\">Get in touch</a></p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Industry Partners"},{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/usitransfer-loghi-collaboration-2023.jpg?itok=vaCPEJs1","alt":"usitransfer-loghi-collaboration-2023","caption":""}]}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"USI Transfer","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer"},{"label":"Mission","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/mission"},{"label":"Team","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/team"},{"label":"Intellectual Property","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/intellectual-property"},{"label":"Success Stories","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/success-stories"},{"label":"Useful Links","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/useful-links"},{"label":"Contact","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/contact"},{"label":"Licensing Opportunities","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/licensing-opportunities"},{"label":"Industrial Agreements","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/industrial-agreements"},{"label":"Collaborate with us","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/partners-innovation"},{"label":"Support","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/support"},{"label":"Grant Support","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/grant-support"},{"label":"Documents","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/documents"},{"label":"For Startups","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/startup"},{"label":"News on Technology Transfer","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/news"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/partners-innovation","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T18:02:04.706Z"}